{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_api_backend_api_referencia", "label": "Refer\u00eancia da API do backend api-externa-backend-v1", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "# API do backend \u2014 refer\u00eancia", "source_url": "http://localhost:8080/swagger-ui.html", "captured_at": "2026-09-01", "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Levantada do c\u00f3digo-fonte do backend (Spring Boot 3.3 / Java 21) e conferida contra a API rodando, e n\u00e3o do openapi.json \u2014 justamente porque o comportamento real diverge do contrato documentado."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_paginacao", "label": "Pagina\u00e7\u00e3o Page<T> do Spring", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Conven\u00e7\u00f5es \u2014 Pagina\u00e7\u00e3o", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Toda listagem devolve Page<T> com page/size/sort; a \u00fanica exce\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 GET /carteiras/{id}/posicoes, que devolve array puro."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_standarderror", "label": "StandardError { timestamp, status, error, message, path, fieldErrors? }", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Conven\u00e7\u00f5es \u2014 Erro", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_erros_nao_mapeados", "label": "Erros n\u00e3o mapeados escapam do StandardError", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Erros", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Par\u00e2metro obrigat\u00f3rio faltando, id n\u00e3o num\u00e9rico e rota inexistente devolvem o corpo default do Spring sem o campo message \u2014 por isso o interceptor precisa de fallback para esse formato."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_exclusao_logica", "label": "Exclus\u00e3o l\u00f3gica (ativo = false)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Conven\u00e7\u00f5es \u2014 Exclus\u00e3o \u00e9 l\u00f3gica", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Investidor, Corretora, A\u00e7\u00e3o e Carteira s\u00f3 marcam ativo = false; a exclus\u00e3o vaza nas buscas por id, que continuam devolvendo 200 para recursos exclu\u00eddos."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_mercado", "label": "Enum Mercado (BR | US)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Conven\u00e7\u00f5es \u2014 Enums", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Define moeda e fonte de cota\u00e7\u00e3o; a moeda da carteira \u00e9 derivada do mercado e nunca enviada pelo cliente."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_tipooperacao", "label": "Enum TipoOperacao (COMPRA | VENDA)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Conven\u00e7\u00f5es \u2014 Enums", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_investidores", "label": "Recurso /investidores", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "### Investidores", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O CPF entra no cadastro mas nunca sai na resposta e n\u00e3o h\u00e1 endpoint de edi\u00e7\u00e3o; GET /investidores/{id} n\u00e3o filtra ativo, ent\u00e3o s\u00f3 a listagem garante investidor vivo."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_corretoras", "label": "Recurso /corretoras e pipeline de cadastro", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "### Corretoras", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O POST envia s\u00f3 o CNPJ e o backend encadeia em s\u00e9rie valida d\u00edgitos \u2192 duplicidade (409) \u2192 BrasilAPI/CNPJ \u2192 BrasilAPI/CVM \u2192 ViaCEP; 'n\u00e3o autorizada' e 'n\u00e3o verific\u00e1vel' s\u00e3o ambos 422 e s\u00f3 diferem pelo texto de message."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_acoes", "label": "Recurso /acoes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "### A\u00e7\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "DELETE usa o ticker como chave, n\u00e3o o id; ticker fora da fonte \u00e9 422 (n\u00e3o 404) e fonte indispon\u00edvel \u00e9 502 no cadastro."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_nomeempresa_null", "label": "nomeEmpresa sempre null", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "### A\u00e7\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "O AcaoService nunca preenche o campo e o null se propaga para as posi\u00e7\u00f5es da carteira, o que invalida qualquer requisito de exibir nome de empresa."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_atualizar_cotacao", "label": "PUT /acoes/{id}/atualizar-cotacao (falha silenciosa)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "### A\u00e7\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "N\u00e3o devolve erro quando a fonte cai: responde 200 com a \u00faltima cota\u00e7\u00e3o conhecida, ent\u00e3o o cliente s\u00f3 sabe se atualizou comparando dataHoraCotacao antes e depois."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_carteiras", "label": "Recurso /carteiras", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "### Carteiras", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "GET /carteiras exige investidorId, renomear \u00e9 a \u00fanica edi\u00e7\u00e3o e n\u00e3o existe GET /carteiras/{id} \u2014 abrir uma carteira obriga listar por investidor e filtrar no cliente."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_rentabilidade_nao_realizada", "label": "rentabilidadeNaoRealizada", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "### Carteiras", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "\u00c9 valor absoluto na moeda \u2014 (cotacaoAtual \u2212 precoMedio) \u00d7 quantidade \u2014 e usa a \u00faltima cota\u00e7\u00e3o salva, que pode estar velha; por isso dataHoraCotacao acompanha o n\u00famero."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_operacoes", "label": "Recurso /operacoes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "### Opera\u00e7\u00f5es", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Compra e venda n\u00e3o enviam pre\u00e7o (a cota\u00e7\u00e3o do momento manda); o PUT n\u00e3o revalida se a nova quantidade deixa a posi\u00e7\u00e3o negativa; GET /operacoes n\u00e3o aceita filtro por carteira, ticker, tipo ou per\u00edodo."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_posicaoservice", "label": "PosicaoService \u2014 posi\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 derivada, n\u00e3o escrita", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Regras de neg\u00f3cio aplicadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Todo insert, update ou delete de opera\u00e7\u00e3o faz o PosicaoService reler o hist\u00f3rico completo do par carteira/a\u00e7\u00e3o e recalcular quantidade e pre\u00e7o m\u00e9dio do zero \u2014 a opera\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 a fonte da verdade, e por isso o cliente deve reler em vez de atualizar posi\u00e7\u00f5es localmente."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_p01", "label": "RN-P01 \u2014 carteira e a\u00e7\u00e3o do mesmo mercado", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Regras de neg\u00f3cio aplicadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_p02", "label": "RN-P02 \u2014 pre\u00e7o m\u00e9dio ponderado em compras sucessivas", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Regras de neg\u00f3cio aplicadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_p03", "label": "RN-P03 \u2014 n\u00e3o se vende mais do que a posi\u00e7\u00e3o atual", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Regras de neg\u00f3cio aplicadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_q04", "label": "RN-Q04 \u2014 compra e venda usam a cota\u00e7\u00e3o do momento", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Regras de neg\u00f3cio aplicadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nunca pre\u00e7o digitado pelo usu\u00e1rio \u2014 o backend busca a cota\u00e7\u00e3o no ato da opera\u00e7\u00e3o."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_q05", "label": "RN-Q05 \u2014 fonte indispon\u00edvel tem mensagem pr\u00f3pria", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Regras de neg\u00f3cio aplicadas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_brasilapi_cnpj", "label": "BrasilAPI / CNPJ", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## APIs externas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_brasilapi_cvm", "label": "BrasilAPI / CVM", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## APIs externas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "S\u00f3 aceita corretora com situa\u00e7\u00e3o EM FUNCIONAMENTO NORMAL; a base \u00e9 do \u00faltimo dia \u00fatil."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_viacep", "label": "ViaCEP", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## APIs externas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_brapi", "label": "brapi.dev (cota\u00e7\u00e3o BR, ~30 min de defasagem)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## APIs externas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "15.000 req/m\u00eas compartilhadas por todos os usu\u00e1rios, j\u00e1 que as chamadas saem do backend \u2014 o que desaconselha bot\u00f5es de 'atualizar tudo'."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_twelve_data", "label": "Twelve Data (cota\u00e7\u00e3o US, 0,3 a 2 min de defasagem)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## APIs externas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "800 cr\u00e9ditos/dia e 8/min compartilhados entre todos os usu\u00e1rios da aplica\u00e7\u00e3o."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_sem_autenticacao", "label": "Lacuna: sem autentica\u00e7\u00e3o", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Lacunas conhecidas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nenhum Spring Security, login ou token: o investidorId \u00e9 escolhido pelo cliente, o que empurra o conceito de 'investidor de contexto' para o frontend."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_sem_cors", "label": "Lacuna: sem CORS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Lacunas conhecidas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nenhum @CrossOrigin nem WebMvcConfigurer, ent\u00e3o o browser n\u00e3o pode chamar localhost:8080 direto \u2014 obriga proxy no dev server."}, {"id": "docs_api_backend_api_sem_agregados", "label": "Lacuna: sem agregados nem saldo em dinheiro", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Lacunas conhecidas", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "N\u00e3o h\u00e1 endpoint de valor investido, valor atual ou aloca\u00e7\u00e3o, e a compra n\u00e3o checa caixa (RN-P06 fora do MVP) \u2014 todo consolidado precisa ser montado no cliente."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_api_backend_api_posicaoservice", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_p02", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "recalcular quantidade e pre\u00e7o m\u00e9dio do zero", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_posicaoservice", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_operacoes", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "A opera\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 a fonte da verdade", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_corretoras", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_brasilapi_cnpj", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "Pipeline do POST, em ordem", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_corretoras", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_brasilapi_cvm", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "Pipeline do POST, em ordem", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_corretoras", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_viacep", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "ViaCEP para endere\u00e7o (com fallback para o endere\u00e7o do CNPJ)", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_acoes", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_brapi", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## APIs externas \u2014 cota\u00e7\u00e3o `BR`", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_acoes", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_twelve_data", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## APIs externas \u2014 cota\u00e7\u00e3o `US`", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_mercado", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_p01", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "Carteira e a\u00e7\u00e3o precisam ser do mesmo mercado", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_carteiras", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_rentabilidade_nao_realizada", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "### Carteiras", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_atualizar_cotacao", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_q05", "relation": "implements", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "atualizar cota\u00e7\u00e3o cai para a \u00faltima conhecida", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_exclusao_logica", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_investidores", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "Exclus\u00e3o l\u00f3gica vaza nas buscas por id", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_erros_nao_mapeados", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_standarderror", "relation": "semantically_similar_to", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.75, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "sem o campo `message`", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_p03", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_operacoes", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "Quantidade excede a posi\u00e7\u00e3o atual", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_rn_q04", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_operacoes", "relation": "conceptually_related_to", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "**Pre\u00e7o n\u00e3o \u00e9 enviado**", "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_api_backend_api_tipooperacao", "target": "docs_api_backend_api_operacoes", "relation": "shares_data_with", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md", "source_location": "## Conven\u00e7\u00f5es \u2014 Enums", "weight": 1.0}], "hyperedges": [{"id": "lacunas_do_backend_que_moldam_o_frontend", "label": "Lacunas do backend que moldaram decis\u00f5es do frontend", "nodes": ["docs_api_backend_api_sem_cors", "docs_api_backend_api_sem_autenticacao", "docs_api_backend_api_sem_agregados", "docs_api_backend_api_nomeempresa_null", "docs_api_backend_api_exclusao_logica", "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_d01_backend_congelado", "docs_superpowers_specs_2026_09_02_frontend_mvp_design_acs_invalidadas"], "relation": "participate_in", "confidence": "INFERRED", "confidence_score": 0.85, "source_file": "docs/api/backend-api.md"}]}